    {
      "h2": "Before you book with your dog",
      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Check the pet fee.</strong> Many hotels charge a per-night or per-stay fee for dogs.</li>\n<li><strong>Check the rules.</strong> Hotels may limit the number or size of dogs, or which rooms and areas they’re allowed in.</li>\n<li><strong>Tell the hotel.</strong> Add your dog to the booking or message the hotel so a suitable room is ready.</li>\n<li><strong>Beach rules.</strong> Some beaches restrict dogs in summer, so check local signs.</li></ul>"
    }
  ],
  "faqs": [
    {
      "q": "How do I find dog-friendly hotels on booking sites?",
      "a": "Most big booking sites have a “pets allowed” or “pet-friendly” filter. Compare across sites with HotelHero, then switch that filter on and read each hotel’s pet policy."
